MODEL
- Kokoro-82M (hexgrad), Apache-2.0 - https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
  Prakriti is a fine-tune of Kokoro-82M; the architecture and initial weights are Kokoro's.
- StyleTTS 2 (Li et al.), MIT - https://github.com/yl4579/StyleTTS2
- kikiri-tts training recipe (semidark), Apache-2.0 - https://github.com/semidark/kikiri-tts

TRAINING DATA (not redistributed; used to train the weights)
- Rasa (AI4Bharat), CC-BY-4.0 - https://huggingface.co/datasets/ai4bharat/Rasa
  Real expressive Hindi studio speech. The voices "Rasa_F" and "Rasa_M" are derived from
  this dataset's female and male speakers. Attribution: Rasa, AI4Bharat, IIT Madras.
- Speech synthesized with Maya 2 Native (Maya Research), Apache-2.0 -
  https://huggingface.co/maya-research/maya2-native
  The voices Ahana, Vaidehi, Malini, Charvi, Anirban, Nakul, Vasant and Siddhant are
  derived from audio generated with this model's built-in voices.
- Training sentences generated with Qwen3-32B-AWQ (Alibaba Qwen), Apache-2.0.
- Word-frequency list derived from Hindi Wikipedia (only word counts were used).

TOOLS USED IN DATA PREPARATION (not redistributed)
- wav2vec2-xlsr-53-espeak-cv-ft (Meta), Apache-2.0 - pronunciation verification
- Whisper large-v3-turbo (OpenAI), MIT - transcript checks
- emotion2vec+ large - emotion scoring
- Indic Parler-TTS and Svara-TTS were evaluated as teachers but not used for training data.

RUNTIME DEPENDENCIES (installed separately, not included)
- kokoro / misaki (hexgrad), Apache-2.0
- espeak-ng, GPL-3.0 (installed by the user as a system package; not bundled)
